<title>USA: Smith Barney Intermediate sets three divs.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney Intermediate sets three divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Intermediate Municipal Fund set a monthly dividend $0.048 per share for January, February and March.</p>
<p>Respective payment dates are January 31, 1997 for stockholders of record January 28, 1997, February 28, 1997 for stockholders of record February 25, 1997 and March 27, 1997 for stockholders of record March 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The company's previous monthly dividend was $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Intermediate is a non-diversified closed-end management investment company.</p>
</text>
